sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SenderDevice as Sender Device
    participant API as API Gateway (TransportModule)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as BullMQ Worker

    SenderDevice->>API: POST /api/v1/conversations/:id/envelopes (IdempotencyKey, OpaquePayload)
    API->>DB: Verify membership & check idempotency key
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO message_envelopes & message_recipient_devices
    API-->>SenderDevice: 201 Created (EnvelopeID, ServerAcceptedAt)
    API->>Worker: Enqueue background delivery task
